# A reuben set file: one send per line, an address, whitespace, then the pattern to the end of
# the line. `reuben live example.reuben` sends every line, then each line you change on save.
#
# `/pattern/in` is the pattern input of the `pattern-melody` library instrument:
# `reuben play instruments/pattern-melody.json` from the repo root plays it.
/pattern/in  0 2 4 <7 5> [4 2] 0 ~ <2 [1 0]>
# /pattern/in  0*2 [2 4]?  <0 7>(3,8)  ~ 4
